sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User / eval
    participant W as Workflow<br/>run_build
    participant C as Coder<br/>AgentLoop
    participant J as Critic · Verifier<br/>Librarian
    participant D as Disk<br/>skills · lessons · checkpoints

    U->>W: run_build(prompt, config)
    W->>D: read lessons (frozen) + skill index
    W->>C: make_coder: prompt + lessons + skill index, register tools
    Note over W,D: round 0: build + open critique
    W->>C: coder.run(prompt)
    Note over C: agent loop (diagram B)
    C-->>W: LoopResult
    W->>J: Critic: renders + scene text
    J-->>W: approved · or issues
    W->>D: checkpoint round0
    loop revision k = 1…N (while not approved)
        W->>C: coder.run(prompt + unresolved issues)
        C-->>W: LoopResult
        W->>J: Verifier: before/after + scene diff
        J-->>W: FIXED / NOT_FIXED per issue
        W->>D: checkpoint roundk
    end
    opt approved and learning on
        W->>J: Librarian: propose skills
        J-->>W: candidate skills
        W->>D: store those passing the gates
    end
    W->>D: final_script · result.json · trace
    W-->>U: approved · rounds · cost
